# Studio probe: velocity picks a dynamic layer, not just a level. The same
# violin E4 played soft (velocity 40, the p layer) then loud (120, the f
# layer): the loud one is louder and brighter.
score 1
tempo 0 120
length 8
tail 0.5
inst violin sfz=../samples/violins_sus.sfz attack=0.05 release=0.2
note 0 3.5 violin E4 40
note 4 3.5 violin E4 120
